load @term/seed/algebra/lie
  find lie-algebra

# The Heisenberg algebra: the Lie algebra of position and momentum, where the bracket of position with momentum is a
# central constant (the canonical commutation relation, the algebraic heart of the uncertainty principle). Its unique
# irreducible representation is quantum mechanics. The form carries the underlying Lie algebra.
form heisenberg-algebra
  link algebra, like lie-algebra
